==English==
{{wp}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɡɛt/|a=RP,GA,CA}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-get.ogg|a=GA}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɡɪt/|q1=regionally restricted}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-git.ogg|a=US,regional}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɡet/|a=AU,NZ}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛt|ɪt|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:geten|id=obtain|tree=+}}
From {{inh|en|enm|geten}}, from {{der|en|non|geta}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*getaną|t=to find; to acquire, attain, get, hold, receive}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*gʰed-|t=to find; to hold; to seize; to take}}. 
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|yol|get|t=to get}}, {{cog|da|gide|t=to care, like}}, {{cog|fo|gita|t=to be able}}, {{cog|is|geta|t=to be able; to beget, father; to achieve, obtain, to guess; to mention}}, {{cog|nn|gjeta}}, {{m|nn|gjete|t=to guess; to mention}}, {{cog|gmq-scy|gida|t=to have the energy to, to feel up for}}, {{m|gmq-scy|gæda|t=to guess}}, {{cog|sv|gita}}, {{m|sv|gitta|t=to be able, to bring oneself to, to care}}, {{cog|got|𐌱𐌹𐌲𐌹𐍄𐌰𐌽|t=to discover, find}}; also {{cog|la|edera}}, {{m|la|hedera|t=ivy}}, {{m|la|praeda|t=booty, pillage, plunder; prey; gain, profit}}, {{m|la|prehendō}}, {{m|la|prēndō|t=to grab, grasp, seize; to attain, reach}}, {{cog|grc|χανδάνω|t=to comprise, contain, hold}}, {{cog|sq|gjej|t=to find}}. 
{{col-bottom}}

